{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>אשר</b> — then he swore." "And the sense of <b>לאביר יעקב</b> — for Jacob made a vow and completed his vow in the place where he said, 'it shall be a house of Elohim.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 132, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra reads the relative אשר here as temporal, 'when/then,' connecting it to the oath."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:32.735144336Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}